WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Crouching light kick intentionally misses before the throw.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.500
Bison completes the first wake-up throw.

3
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.400
The medium-overhead target chain reaches the mined Ryu.

4
00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.200
Jumping medium punches pick up the explosion launch.

5
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.100
Forward heavy punch leads into light Backfist Combo.
